SUMMARY:Discovering Herbal Allies Series
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n***When:*** *Satur
 day - October 10th\, and every 2nd Saturday of the Month thru February 202
 7*\n***Where:*** \\*\\*\\**[Unity Holistic Wellness Center](www.unityholis
 ticwellnesscenter.org) 5124 Departure Dr. Ste 108 - Raleigh NC*\n***Fees:*
 ** *$10 - $20 per person*\nRegister and pay here: [www.unityholisticwellne
 sscenter.org](www.unityholisticwellnesscenter.org/workshops)\n\n***Herbal 
 Allies Series #2 is coming up!*** This month's workshop led by local herba
 list and evolving astrologer LeAnna Cargman will introduce an immune heali
 ng plant\, and learn the following:\n\\* Use your senses to explore and id
 entify medicinal uses\, herbal actions and gifts that this featured plant 
 offers\n\\* Learn folklore\, history and astrological associations\n\\* Le
 arn how to harvest and prepare herbal teas\n\\* Get take-home tips and sam
 ples\n\nCome and join us!
