SUMMARY:Be and Feel Good Enough to End Anxiety\, Struggle\, and Exhaustion
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nA strange thing ha
 ppens when perfectly good people ponder a lie: they start imagining that t
 hey’re not good enough\, until they actually become not good enough. The
 y can feel that something is wrong\, but they think that people are the pr
 oblem while the false thinking is true. Of course that’s the point\, bec
 ause the lies must cover up for not being good enough while human beings w
 ere always better than they ever knew. Trying to win at this rigged losing
  game is now causing epidemic anxiety\, struggle and exhaustion. Many beco
 me so desperate to survive on lies that they become their own lie. They ig
 nore the most basic emotional facts while spreading conspiracy theories to
  play hero for the paranoid. Insecure narcissists and demagogues pretend t
 o be powerful by instinctively misleading everyone to react for or against
  them\, with either way feeding the lies. The truth is increasingly obviou
 s yet remains so unfamiliar and unpopular that many will ignore their own 
 answers to the bitter end. Forget what’s out there\; you must be and fee
 l good enough inside to remember what’s true for you.\n\nJoin us this Su
 nday Oct 11\, 2026 for a free heart-and-mind opening talk on what it means
  to really know that you’re always good enough. I’ve been training my 
 whole life with my spirit guides to help humanity through the transition t
 oday\, and I’m still amazed at what it feels like to experience the beau
 ty of the human potential. Life isn’t hard\; that was a lie. Nothing is 
 ever lost\, neither in time nor space\; those were more lies. Hard work an
 d struggle aren’t noble or effective\, they only bring more hard work an
 d struggle. Nobody ever changes anyone or anything else\, so to try is the
  cause of endless stress and distress. Just by discovering and choosing wh
 at’s true for you\, you will change automatically and enter a new better
  world. Everyone is continually creating their own next future timeline\, 
 so predicting and planning from the past cannot work. You’re always pred
 estined to live happily ever after. You just have to learn how to let it b
 e true.\n\nWe’ll see how belief systems work to create the layers of rea
 lity experience that can seem so real until they reach a dead end. Stop tr
 ying to fix what’s always been broken. Understand that you already have 
 what always works. You’ll learn how the spirit human partnership within 
 you functions most beautifully to rescue yourself and show the way home. Y
 our human emotions are the secret treasure or curse\, as you choose to eit
 her reactively feed the reality that’s controlling you\, or responsively
  grow your spiritual abilities to live your own destiny. You’ll learn ho
 w to escape the traps of anxiety\, panic\, and compulsions of low self-est
 eem like procrastination and addictive pleasures. The combination of human
  and spiritual perspectives is needed to catch traumatic lies and replace 
 them with deeper solutions. We’ll conclude with a guided meditation to l
 et your soul family and friends lead you into the plans you already made a
 t higher levels for your own best happiness.\n\nWelcome! Our Inner Selves 
 Mastery spiritual support group is free online every Sunday 11am-1:30pm ES
 T\, with the last half hour for a guided meditation. You can signup here f
 or this meeting\, check [www.meetup.com/Inner-Selves-for-Outer-Mastery](ht
 tp://www.meetup.com/Inner-Selves-for-Outer-Mastery) for all events\, and v
 isit our landing page at [www.signupism.com](http://www.signupism.com) for
  newsletter\, YouTube channel\, and more.\n\nWHAT TO EXPECT: Meetings are 
 online with zoom\, link posted by day of meeting. Each week Spirit gives m
 e a theme to explore for loving empowerment and reality creation. I gather
  teachings from my spiritual psychology system and learn more throughout t
 he week until I write a channeled manifesto to focus the meeting. Our form
 at works great with 4 parts: intro\, check-ins\, main talk\, and guided me
 ditation to put ideas into practice.\n\nBACKGROUND: My name is Carl\, I’
 m a spiritual teacher and life coach. My Spirit team has guided me for ove
 r 30 years to develop a system for personal evolution called Inner Selves 
 Mastery\, which shows how the many parts of You can work better with the S
 ource to live in a loving Universe. I’ve been leading groups for over 25
  years\, and since the massive shifts of 2020 offering as much support as 
 I can.\n\nBest wishes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nspiritual teaching and coa
 ching\n[www.InnerSelvesMastery.com](http://www.InnerSelvesMastery.com)\nww
 w.SignupISM.com = quick links for newsletter\, YouTube channel\, more
