SUMMARY: Beginner Square Dance Lessons in Raleigh - First Night
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n**Try something ne
 w this fall—join our square dance lessons and discover the joy of dancin
 g\, community\, and fun!**\n\nEver thought *“I want to try something new
  \, something different and fun”*? Square dancing in Raleigh is social\,
  active\, and surprisingly easy — even if you’ve never danced before.\
 n\nJoin **Capital Squares** for the **first night of our beginner lesson s
 eries** on **Tuesday\, October 13\, 2026**\, and see if it clicks. Grab yo
 ur tickets here: [https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1996313880556](https://www.
 eventbrite.com/e/1996313880556)\n\n🕺 **What to Expect**\n\n* Beginner-f
 riendly instruction — **no experience needed**\n* Gentle\, fun movement 
 that keeps your brain and body engaged\n* Friendly\, welcoming group — n
 o partner required\n* Plenty of laughs and small victories\n* Dancing to a
  variety of familiar music styles\n* Meet new friends — people from all 
 walks of life come to dance.\n\n👥 **Who This Is Perfect For**\n\n* Abso
 lute beginners curious about square dancing\n* Anyone seeking a social\, l
 ow-pressure activity\n* People looking for a fresh\, fun hobby\n* Solo att
 endees — most people come alone\n\n🤍 **For Nervous First-Timers**\nYo
 u **don’t need to be coordinated or confident**. The first night is low-
 pressure\, paced for beginners\, and designed to be fun from the start. Ma
 ny who felt nervous walked out smiling — ready for the next week.\n\n
 💬 **What First-Timers Say**\n*"I thought I’d feel awkward\, but I lau
 ghed the whole time and actually learned something!"*\n*"I came alone\, bu
 t everyone was so friendly — I can’t wait for the next week."*\n\n**Ev
 ent Details**\n\n* **Date:** Tuesday\, October 13\, 2026\n* **Time:** 7–
 9 PM\n* **Location:** St. James United Methodist Church\n* **Cost:** $10 f
 or the first night\n* **Tickets:** [https://www.eventbrite.com/e/199631388
 0556](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1996313880556)\n\n⚠️ **Only 40 spot
 s for new dancers!**\n\n💡 **About the Full Series**\n\n* **12-week begi
 nner series** if you decide to continue\n* **Total cost:** $96 (payable in
  2 installments of $48)\n* **No commitment** required to attend the first 
 night - try it first!\n\n🎯 **Why Start Now?**\nYou don't want to miss o
 ut and spots fill quickly! Try the first night before life gets busy.\n
 👉 **Reserve your spot now and try it out!**\n\n**Note: Space is limited
  to 40 new dancers!** Grab your tickets on [Eventbrite](https://www.eventb
 rite.com/e/1996313880556) before they sell out. Your ticket purchase via E
 ventbrite guarantees your spot on the dance floor!\n\nThere is no need to 
 RSVP on meet-up in order to attend! **This event is cross-posted\, open to
  the public and well attended.**\n\n**Questions:**\nContact Eva Murray: [9
 19-926-8095](tel:9199268095) \\| info@CapitalSquares\\.org\nVisit [https:/
 /CapitalSquares.org/learn](https://capitalsquares.org/learn)\nCheck us out
  on [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/capitalsquares) or [Instagram](htt
 ps://www.instagram.com/capital_squares_raleigh/)
