 e ends Oct 13th!\nCary’s Wednesday night Latin dance social is where the
  community comes together to DANCE! 💃🏽🕺🏽\n\n🔥 WEEKLY LATIN 
 DANCE SOCIAL\n🔥 BEGINNER-FRIENDLY DANCE LESSON\n🔥 SPACIOUS DANCE FLO
 OR\n🔥 COOL A/C + COMFORTABLE DANCE SPACE + FANS\n🔥 DRINK SPECIALS 
