SUMMARY:GHOST DANCE
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n**GHOST DANCE**\n\
 n**October 16\, 2026** (Friday)\, **8**pm\nOakwood Cemetery in Downtown Ra
 leigh\n(700 Oakwood Ave.)\n\n**ABOUT OUR GHOST DANCE**\nLearn the GHOST DA
 NCE as we dance\nin the street among Night Creatures.\nYou'll be taught si
 mple moves\,\nthen we'll put the music on\nand we'll be dancing in the str
 eet!\nIf you're not a dancer\,\nyou can come and simply watch.\n\n**WHERE:
 **\nHistoric Oakwood in downtown Raleigh.\nMeet right outside the Oakwood 
 Cemetery Gate\nat 700 Oakwood Ave. by 8:00pm.\n\n**PARKING:**\nPark anywhe
 re along the side streets.\nThere’s plenty of parking.\nNote that this e
 vent takes place\nOUTSIDE the cemetery.\n\n**TIME:**\nWe begin at **8:00**
  pm.\n\n**HOW LONG WILL IT LAST?**\nThis event should last about 1 hour.\n
 \n**COST:** $5 (for charity)\nPlease have exact change (cash).\nAll money 
 collected goes to help prevent cruelty to animals.\n\n**WEBSITE:**\n*[http
 s](https://www.redsunacademy.com/ghost-walk/photos-ghost.html)[:](https://
 www.youtube.com/watch?v=S6-W4j9NmpI&feature=youtu.be)//[www.redsunacademy.
 com/ghost-walk](http://www.redsunacademy.com/ghost-walk/photos-ghost.html)
 *\n\n**WHAT IF IT RAINS?**\nThis event is canceled if it rains in Raleigh 
 that night.\n\n**WARNING**: There will be strobe lights.\nWarning given to
  those who are sensitive to strobe lights.\n\\~\\~\\~\\~\\~\\~\\~\\~\\~\\~
 \\~\n**FAQ:**\n\n**IS THIS A CHILD-FRIENDLY EVENT?**\nThis is mostly an ev
 ent for adults and teens\, tho kids can join in. However\, the steps will 
 be too challenging for small children.\n\n**IS PARKING A PROBLEM?**\nThere
 ’s plenty of parking\, tho you may have to walk a block or two. Park any
 where on the surrounding neighborhood streets.\n\n**HOW IS THIS EVENT DIFF
 ERENT FROM PAST YEARS?**\nIn past years\, we’ve had storytellers telling
  haunted tales and over a dozen 'Night Creatures' who performed scary acts
  as we walked the streets. Everyone loved the ZOMBIE DANCE at the end\, wi
 th several people saying it was their favorite part of the evening. So to 
 be different\, we decided to have the entire evening be a GHOST DANCE!\n\n
 **HOW WILL I FIND THE CHECK-IN DESK?**\nOur sign-in desk is in front of th
 e cemetery gate (a little to the left of the gate\, as you face the gate f
 rom the street).\n\n**DOES THIS TAKE PLACE IN THE CEMETERY?**\nNo. The cem
 etery closes at dark except when they have an event. We dance outside the 
 gate\, and have staff protecting us from cars and traffic.\n\n**DO WE WEAR
  COSTUMES?**\nIt would be fun if you wear a costume\, but it's optional. S
 ome do\, some don't.\n..............\n**PHOTOS** (from past years)**:**\n*
 [https](https://www.redsunacademy.com/ghost-walk/photos-ghost.html)[:](htt
 ps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S6-W4j9NmpI&feature=youtu.be)//[www.redsunaca
 demy.com/ghost-walk/photos-ghost.html](http://www.redsunacademy.com/ghost-
 walk/photos-ghost.html)*\n\n**GHOST WALK** (video of our Ghost Walk)**:**\
 n*[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S6-W4j9NmpI&feature=youtu.be](https://w
 ww.youtube.com/watch?v=S6-W4j9NmpI&feature=youtu.be)*
